  vendorName: Seamstress Maude
  offerText: Your heavy winter quilts are made of premium wool. I need them for the
    royal guard. You will freeze tonight, but I pay very well and your bed will be
    clear.
  acceptResultText: Maude takes your blankets. You are richer and have more space,
    but you spend the night shivering violently, deeply miserable in the bitter cold.
  rejectResultText: You aggressively protect your bedding. You sleep warmly and comfortably,
    ignoring the royal guard's needs.
